  "query_preview": "/Friday through early next week/ \n\nShortwave ridging will build across the Upper Mississippi \nValley and western Great Lakes Friday into Saturday, shunting \nthe departing trough toward northern New England and supporting \na welcome return to tranquil, mild conditions. Recent global \nensemble suites have backed off previous solutions depicting a \nfast-moving clipper diving into the Missouri Valley by Sunday, \nkeeping notable dynamic forcing displaced well north and east of\nIllinois. This trend favors dry and benign weather persisting \ninto early next week, with daily afternoon highs hovering near \n60 degrees and overnight lows settling around 40 degrees.",
